The cursor's deployment inside victim networks by ransomware groups shows how widely the ai coding tool has spread through the musk stack. This is SpaceX Daily, episode 82. A new rendering released by SpaceX depicts the starship v4 upper stage at approximately 70 meters, only 1 meter shorter than the super heavy v3 booster at 71 meters. The near equal stack heights alter the vehicle's center of mass location during a scent and catch attempts.

